                        </list></item>
                    <item><list>
                            <label rendition="#italic">White House</label>
                            <item>Mr. Edwin Meese III,
                                Counsellor to the President</item>
                            <item>Mr. James A. Baker III,
                                Chief of Staff to the President</item>
                            <item>Mr. Michael K. Deaver,
                                Deputy Chief of Staff to the President</item>
                            <item>Mr. William P. Clark,
                                Assistant to the President for National Security Affairs</item>
                            <item>Mr. Martin Anderson,
                                Assistant to the President for Policy Development</item>
                            <item>Mr. Richard G. Darman, Assistant to the President and Deputy to
                                the Chief of Staff</item>
                            <item>Admiral James W. Nance,
                                Deputy Assistant to the President for National Security
                                Affairs</item>
                            <item>Mr. Robert C. McFarlane,
                                Deputy Assistant to the President for National Security
